        "text": {
            "*": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: #fff;\">\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:-5px;margin-right:-5px\"><small title=\"编辑这个页面\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/sr/index.php?title=API&amp;action=edit\">编</a></small>&#160;<small title=\"清除这个页面的缓存\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/sr/index.php?title=API&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></small>&#160;<small title=\"查看这个页面的编辑历史\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/sr/index.php?title=API&amp;action=history\">历</a></small>&#160;<small title=\"短网址，按右键复制链接地址\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/sr/?curid=\">短</a></small>&#160;<small title=\"查看这个页面\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/sr/API\">阅</a></small></div><a href=\"/sr/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/sr/%E5%91%BD%E8%B7%AF%E6%AD%A7%E5%9B%BE\" title=\"命路歧图\">命路歧图</a> &gt; <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">API</a><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<center><div style=\"border-radius: 6px;padding: 10px;background:#e0edff;border: 1px solid #d0d0d0;border-left: 5px solid rgb(77 120 216 / 78%);margin-bottom:5px;width:100%;max-width:100%;text-align:left\">如果是第一次来，按\"Ctrl+D\"可以收藏随时查看更新~觉得WIKI好玩的话，请推荐给朋友哦～(◕ω＜)☆<br />\n按右上角“WIKI功能→编辑”即可修改页面内容。</div></center>\n<div class=\"linebox\" id=\"myViewport\">\n<div id=\"myContent\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasLine\" id=\"fatesAtlasLine\" data-ligature=\"tm1-ch1,tm1-ch2,tm1-ch3,tm1-ch4,ch3-tm2,ch2-tm3,ch4-tm4,ch1-tm5,tm2-tm6,tm3-tm6,tm4-tm6,tm5-tm6,tm6-tm7,tm7-ch5,tm7-ch6,tm7-ch7,ch6-tm8,ch7-tm9,ch5-tm10\"><div class=\"canvas\"></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasTree\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM Char infoBox\" data-name=\"纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬-1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/9/95/ft5iobcasvdd53x3rmbtbuoaklapktv.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><img alt=\"命路歧图-纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬-2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/2/24/75icj2nnmxg6vlnjkpu4dd939pv4jcp.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm1\">纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬\" class=\"name\">纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><div class=\"Char\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬-1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/9/95/ft5iobcasvdd53x3rmbtbuoaklapktv.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><img alt=\"命路歧图-纺锤啊，难纴岁月的经纬-2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/2/24/75icj2nnmxg6vlnjkpu4dd939pv4jcp.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"text\">距离击退盗火行者，夺回<ruby><rb><span>欧洛尼斯</span></rb><rt style=\"font-size:0.75em\"><span>岁月之泰坦</span></rt></ruby>的火种已经过去了一段时间，你也接受到众黄金裔的邀请，挑战「岁月」试炼。然而岁月的试炼并不在过去与现在，而是在「未来」——你被告知你早在坠落翁法罗斯的途中就已经死亡，而如今的你不过一簇行走的记忆…是为完成试炼，更是为了拯救自己，你必须夺回自己的未来。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"遐蝶头像.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/0/0b/919jyvnqupiznu3bun1jsv4828c5v5e.png/80px-%E9%81%90%E8%9D%B6%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/0/0b/919jyvnqupiznu3bun1jsv4828c5v5e.png/120px-%E9%81%90%E8%9D%B6%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/0/0b/919jyvnqupiznu3bun1jsv4828c5v5e.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch1\">遐蝶：灰烬如群蝶飘落</div></div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"丹恒头像.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/1/16/2azx7sziv59w0u8v8dk4ysimt4aauys.png/80px-%E4%B8%B9%E6%81%92%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/1/16/2azx7sziv59w0u8v8dk4ysimt4aauys.png/120px-%E4%B8%B9%E6%81%92%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/1/16/2azx7sziv59w0u8v8dk4ysimt4aauys.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch2\">丹恒：坼树之下，探渊索珠</div></div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"那刻夏头像.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/2/22/mmjtvrh1zjd5f5jrlbbhuko7nmukodh.png/80px-%E9%82%A3%E5%88%BB%E5%A4%8F%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/2/22/mmjtvrh1zjd5f5jrlbbhuko7nmukodh.png/120px-%E9%82%A3%E5%88%BB%E5%A4%8F%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/2/22/mmjtvrh1zjd5f5jrlbbhuko7nmukodh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch3\">那刻夏：与神对谈的黄昏</div></div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS Char\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"开拓者头像-1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/5/52/rhgkx12fxucnesllif85tatcmhxqex3.png/80px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E2%80%A2%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/5/52/rhgkx12fxucnesllif85tatcmhxqex3.png/120px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E2%80%A2%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/5/52/rhgkx12fxucnesllif85tatcmhxqex3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><img alt=\"开拓者头像-2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/3/39/akktv7rtbxjs4eqvg8krqzotlukg00a.png/80px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/3/39/akktv7rtbxjs4eqvg8krqzotlukg00a.png/120px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F-2.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/3/39/akktv7rtbxjs4eqvg8krqzotlukg00a.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch4\">开拓者：开拓记事</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/7/7c/n9iqiv9ccegp5c5ptplkqu9x0m78xc8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm2\">橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主\" class=\"name\">橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-橄榄啊，请掷向议厅之主.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/7/7c/n9iqiv9ccegp5c5ptplkqu9x0m78xc8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">身负「理性」火种的那刻夏主动联系元老院，并承诺帮助元老院扳倒黄金裔、停止逐火之旅，以此交换元老院的庇护。合作达成后，那刻夏在「神礼观众」的授意下动身前往泰坦断崖，觐见刻法勒的奥体…在登山道上，他再度经历濒死体验，见到了不寻常的记忆。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/6/61/lbpeeytwi9tuz8qvv5n6isoyhhrutnb.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm3\">莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想\" class=\"name\">莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-莎草啊，抽绎渎神者所想.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/6/61/lbpeeytwi9tuz8qvv5n6isoyhhrutnb.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">黑潮倾覆树庭后，丹恒在风堇的帮助下重返树庭抢救有关「天空」泰坦的资料。在整理资料的过程中，无意间发现了与那刻夏相关的研究——随着两人进一步搜寻，从不同文本中推理出那刻夏的真实目的为「将自身与泰坦的火种熔合」。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/8/8d/hfkm8m59snbjcafk7ekq0esx78ia5ve.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm4\">争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼\" class=\"name\">争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-争辩啊，代长矛分庭抗礼.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/8/8d/hfkm8m59snbjcafk7ekq0esx78ia5ve.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">为了避免「理性」火种落入图谋不轨的元老院手中，你与阿格莱雅等人共同前往黎明云崖希望能带走那刻夏，然而议院的公开会议却将矛头指向黄金裔。由于得到了那刻夏与遐蝶的「支持」，元老凯妮斯向公众阐述了「重归黄金世」的可能，并将由公民大会决定是否暂停逐火之旅。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/8/84/2wsxtg96v80e8lx01j2mj37aojw7i1i.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm5\">断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪\" class=\"name\">断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-断梦啊，从夙世捎来启迪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/8/84/2wsxtg96v80e8lx01j2mj37aojw7i1i.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">遐蝶向众人解释自己站在元老院一侧的原因——作为交换条件，她能得到「死亡」泰坦的下落。在那刻夏探究的刻法勒记忆中，一对双子通过了泰坦试炼，一人死去，另一人成为了「死亡」泰坦。这些线索也将成为拯救你的关键。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"行者啊，向冥河解缆起航\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-行者啊，向冥河解缆起航.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/f/ff/4kx3qklvqz3hg7945luniwdd4t0mw42.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm6\">行者啊，向冥河解缆起航</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"行者啊，向冥河解缆起航\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/行者啊，向冥河解缆起航\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"行者啊，向冥河解缆起航\" class=\"name\">行者啊，向冥河解缆起航</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-行者啊，向冥河解缆起航.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/f/ff/4kx3qklvqz3hg7945luniwdd4t0mw42.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">前往冥河环伺的斯缇科西亚并非易事，阿格莱雅花费重金将不在城中的「诡计」半神赛飞儿请回，希望她能提供帮助。半夜，你听见遐蝶的敲门声，随即与她在奥赫玛城中同行，聊起她曾经在哀地里亚的过往…不料，遐蝶精心准备的礼物却被「小贼」顺走。经过一番折腾，你们与赛飞儿约好在奥赫玛城外见面，动身前往斯缇科西亚。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/b/b7/t1yuhb3l0c7p1pzc9ad18bq9pliap8n.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm7\">摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流\" class=\"name\">摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-摇船啊，请载我横渡冥流.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/b/b7/t1yuhb3l0c7p1pzc9ad18bq9pliap8n.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">到达斯缇科西亚之后，你与遐蝶目睹了已死却未往生的亡魂们所经历的痛苦，他们因翁法罗斯生死失序而承受痛苦。随着旅程的深入，遐蝶也从亡魂那里了解到搁浅的死龙，以及随之带来「死亡」的少女，才明白<ruby><rb><span>塞纳托斯</span></rb><rt style=\"font-size:0.75em\"><span>死亡之泰坦</span></rt></ruby>为了复活前世的姐姐已经殁于冥河之中，而自己正是那名死之少女。在众人的帮助下，你与遐蝶在高塔之上完成了炼金阵法炼成了死龙。而你的「未来」将尽，遐蝶乘着死龙回到了冥界，完成了「死亡」试炼，取得半神的权能。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"大黑塔头像.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/a/a1/j0o7ek6lpq7tilhdk79b5bdwuiis9zi.png/80px-%E5%A4%A7%E9%BB%91%E5%A1%94%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/a/a1/j0o7ek6lpq7tilhdk79b5bdwuiis9zi.png/120px-%E5%A4%A7%E9%BB%91%E5%A1%94%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/a/a1/j0o7ek6lpq7tilhdk79b5bdwuiis9zi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch5\">黑塔：谁为残酷协议负责</div></div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"那刻夏头像.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/2/22/mmjtvrh1zjd5f5jrlbbhuko7nmukodh.png/80px-%E9%82%A3%E5%88%BB%E5%A4%8F%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/2/22/mmjtvrh1zjd5f5jrlbbhuko7nmukodh.png/120px-%E9%82%A3%E5%88%BB%E5%A4%8F%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/2/22/mmjtvrh1zjd5f5jrlbbhuko7nmukodh.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch6\">那刻夏：与神对谈的黄昏</div></div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlas JS Char\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"开拓者头像-1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/5/52/rhgkx12fxucnesllif85tatcmhxqex3.png/80px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E2%80%A2%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/5/52/rhgkx12fxucnesllif85tatcmhxqex3.png/120px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E2%80%A2%E6%AF%81%E7%81%AD%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/5/52/rhgkx12fxucnesllif85tatcmhxqex3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><img alt=\"开拓者头像-2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/3/39/akktv7rtbxjs4eqvg8krqzotlukg00a.png/80px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/thumb/3/39/akktv7rtbxjs4eqvg8krqzotlukg00a.png/120px-%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93%E8%80%85%E5%A4%B4%E5%83%8F-2.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/3/39/akktv7rtbxjs4eqvg8krqzotlukg00a.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"ch7\">开拓者：开拓记事</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/d/d2/ni8emr2kr48pmsatry5rgq10ph3e2l7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm8\">公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声\" class=\"name\">公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-公民啊，倾听那汹涌潮声.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/d/d2/ni8emr2kr48pmsatry5rgq10ph3e2l7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">十五个门扉时即将结束，在公民大会的会场里，白厄代表众黄金裔发出继续逐火之旅的讲演，并博得了广泛认可…那刻夏的灵魂见证到了刻法勒记忆中的双子，由此他确信完成逐火之旅，自己将成为再创世的泰坦，于是将手中最后一枚陶片掷出——公民大会决议通过，继续逐火之旅。在「背叛」元老院之后，那刻夏公开自己渎神罪行，并向公民们宣告元老院与自己同罪。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM Char infoBox\" data-name=\"学者啊，于真理门前再会\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-学者啊，于真理门前再会-1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/9/93/7i5k66qa5925crc8k6i041j3elw583b.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><img alt=\"命路歧图-学者啊，于真理门前再会-2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/6/6b/mmnyvbb3bo52swhnpywnne7d70uyzjs.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm9\">学者啊，于真理门前再会</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"学者啊，于真理门前再会\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/学者啊，于真理门前再会\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"学者啊，于真理门前再会\" class=\"name\">学者啊，于真理门前再会</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><div class=\"Char\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-学者啊，于真理门前再会-1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/9/93/7i5k66qa5925crc8k6i041j3elw583b.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><img alt=\"命路歧图-学者啊，于真理门前再会-2.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/6/6b/mmnyvbb3bo52swhnpywnne7d70uyzjs.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"text\">在得到<ruby><rb><span>塞纳托斯</span></rb><rt style=\"font-size:0.75em\"><span>死亡之泰坦</span></rt></ruby>的权能后，遐蝶引导着你借助生前回忆，抵抗死国的诱惑走出了冥界。你与遐蝶相拥，她将「死亡」火种交予你，随后她将回到冥地维持翁法罗斯的生死流转。在你回到创世涡心之后，在众黄金裔的注视下，归还了「死亡」的火种。你们也一同见证了那刻夏的最后时刻——他完成了「理性」试炼，并取出胸中的火种，身躯彻底消殒。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasBranch\">\n<div class=\"fatesAtlasPlaceholder\"></div> \n<div class=\"fatesAtlas TM infoBox\" data-name=\"魔女的镜中回天\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasIcon\"><img alt=\"命路歧图-魔女的镜中回天.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/3/37/9nus6oqvcsubmshmixve9q6psn9ymxz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasText\" data-index=\"tm10\">魔女的镜中回天</div><div class=\"fatesAtlasInfo\" data-name=\"魔女的镜中回天\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"infoContent\"><a href=\"/sr/魔女的镜中回天\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"魔女的镜中回天\" class=\"name\">魔女的镜中回天</a><hr /><a href=\"/sr/走过安眠地的花丛\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"走过安眠地的花丛\" class=\"title\">走过安眠地的花丛</a><img alt=\"命路歧图-魔女的镜中回天.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/3/37/9nus6oqvcsubmshmixve9q6psn9ymxz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"552\" height=\"244\" data-file-width=\"552\" data-file-height=\"244\" /><div class=\"text\">博识尊谒见进程被瓦尔特和星期日打断后，黑塔表现出了对翁法罗斯的兴趣，并利用魔镜将自己的「数据精神体」折跃至翁法罗斯入口。来古士随即出现，以「绝灭大君」为威胁，警告黑塔不应继续深入。</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"fatesAtlasLine-infocontent\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"fatesAtlasLine-infoclose\"></div><div class=\"fatesAtlasLine-infocontent\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<p><style type=\"text/css\">\n.linebox {\n\twidth: 100%;\n\theight: calc(100vh - 50px);\n\toverflow: hidden;\n\tbackground-image: url(https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/c/c2/kcuv2h1bvqya4deyvyk0ajedxxjuwar.png);\n\tbackground-size: cover;\n\tbackground-position: center;\n\tposition: relative;\n}\n.linebox img {\n\tpointer-events: none;\n\tuser-select: none;\n}\ndiv#myContent>div {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\tposition: absolute;\n\ttransform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n\ttop: 50%;\n\tleft: 50%;\n}\ndiv#myContent {\n\twidth: 100%;\n\theight: 100%;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\tposition: relative;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine>.canvas>canvas {\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tz-index: -1;\n\tleft: 0px;\n\ttop: 0px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlasTree {\n\tdisplay: inline-flex;\n\tflex-wrap: nowrap;\n\tflex-direction: row;\n\tmargin: 5em 0;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlasbranch {\n\tdisplay: inline-flex;\n\tflex-direction: column;\n\tjustify-content: flex-start;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlasPlaceholder {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\twidth: 320px;\n\theight: 165px;\n\tmargin: 25px 45px;\n\tposition: relative;\n\ttransition: all 0.5s;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas {\n\tcursor: pointer;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas:hover {\n\ttransform: scale(1.05);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.NP,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlasPlaceholder.NP {\n\theight: 45px;\n\tmargin: 30px 45px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tdisplay: inline-flex;\n\talign-items: center;\n\tjustify-content: center;\n\tposition: absolute;\n\ttop: 0;\n\tright: 0;\n\twidth: 300px;\n\theight: 135px;\n\toverflow: hidden;\n\tborder: 3px solid #fff;\n\ttransition: all 0.5s;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.FM .fatesAtlasIcon,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.F .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tborder-color: #A086D4;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.T .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tborder-color: #E3BF82;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas:hover .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tborder-width: 4px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.DT .fatesAtlasIcon,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.JS .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tborder-color: transparent;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.DT .fatesAtlasIcon,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.JS .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tleft: 130px;\n\ttransform: translateX(-50%);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TBC .fatesAtlasIcon {\n\tborder-color: #E0E1E3;\n\tborder-width: 2px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.Char .fatesAtlasIcon img {\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tleft: 50%;\n\ttop: 50%;\n\ttransform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n\tanimation: charswitch 10s infinite ease;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.Char .fatesAtlasIcon img:nth-child(1) {\n\tanimation-delay: 0s;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.Char .fatesAtlasIcon img:nth-child(2) {\n\tanimation-delay: -5s;\n}\n@keyframes charswitch {\n\tfrom {\n\t\topacity: 1;\n\t\tz-index: 1;\n\t}\n\t/* 0 ~ 50 正常变化，逐渐变透明露出底图 */\n\t50% {\n\t\topacity: 0;\n\t\tz-index: 1;\n\t}\n\t/* 变透明后移动到下一层（被遮盖） */\n\t50.1% {\n\t\topacity: 0;\n\t\tz-index: 0;\n\t}\n\t/* 被遮盖后变回不透明，作为底图，在展示图变透明时不会露出站点背景 */\n\t50.2% {\n\t\topacity: 1;\n\t\tz-index: 0;\n\t}\n\t/* 保持被遮盖，避免中途 z-index 突增导致的突然变化遮盖顶图 */\n\t99.9% {\n\t\topacity: 1;\n\t\tz-index: 0;\n\t}\n\t/* 回归初始状态 */\n\t100% {\n\t\topacity: 1;\n\t\tz-index: 1;\n\t}\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas .fatesAtlasText {\n\tdisplay: inline-flex;\n\tflex-wrap: wrap;\n\talign-items: center;\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tbottom: 0;\n\tleft: 0;\n\twidth: 260px;\n\theight: 45px;\n\tbackground-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 75%);\n\tcolor: #fff;\n\tborder: 2px solid #fff;\n\tborder-left-width: 25px;\n\tborder-top-right-radius: 15px;\n\tfont-size: 20px;\n\tline-height: 1;\n\tletter-spacing: 1px;\n\tpadding-left: 10px;\n\tz-index: 1;\n}/*\nTM 开拓任务\nTC 开拓续闻\nCM 同行任务\nAM 冒险任务 */\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TM .fatesAtlasText,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.FM .fatesAtlasText,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.F .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder-color: #f2b438;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.T .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder-left-width: 2px;\n\tborder-color: #595B5C;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TC .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder-color: #FE8D47;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.CM .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder-color: #B98CF7;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.AM .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder-color: #61D7EF;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TE .fatesAtlasText,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.JS .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder: none;\n\tbackground-color: transparent;\n\ttext-align: center;\n\tfont-size: 25px;\n\tpadding: 0 0.5em;\n\tline-height: 1.2;\n\tjustify-content: center;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TE .fatesAtlasText {\n\tfont-size: 30px;\n\ttop: 50%;\n\tbottom: unset;\n\ttransform: translateY(-50%);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TBC .fatesAtlasText {\n\tborder-color: transparent;\n\tbackground-color: transparent;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas:not(.JS, .TE) .fatesAtlasText:before {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\twidth: 25px;\n\theight: 25px;\n\tcontent: '';\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tleft: -25px;\n\tbackground-size: auto 25px;\n\tbackground-repeat: no-repeat;\n\tbackground-position: center;\n\tfilter: invert(1);\n}/*\nTM 开拓任务\nTC 开拓续闻\nCM 同行任务\nAM 冒险任务 */\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TM .fatesAtlasText:before {\n\tbackground-image: url(https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/d/d2/6v855v0vybwrvmd0wems2rqcel8vov3.png);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.FM .fatesAtlasText:before,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.TC .fatesAtlasText:before,\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.F .fatesAtlasText:before {\n\tbackground-image: url(https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/e/ea/l48xsyzx0h95wvf55yhu0iw8dze1l8r.png);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.CM .fatesAtlasText:before {\n\tbackground-image: url(https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/e/ee/ozgp2z95xteotxotvuamutxn2wpqbd8.png);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.AM .fatesAtlasText:before {\n\tbackground-image: url(https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/9/96/c0o8cml902xe5e2lelig8ujz9thxdo0.png);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.DT .fatesAtlasText:before {\n\tbackground-image: url(https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/sr/4/44/1vacie0fpy9939ydcl8dq6rzfdgxpu8.png);\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas:not(.TBC, .JS, .TE) .fatesAtlasText:after {\n\tcontent: '';\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\twidth: 261px;\n\theight: 46px;\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tleft: -25px;\n\ttop: -2px;\n\tborder: 3px solid transparent;\n\tborder-top-right-radius: 15px;\n\ttransition: all 0.5s;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas.T .fatesAtlasText:after {\n\tleft: -2px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine .fatesAtlas:not(.TBC):hover .fatesAtlasText:after {\n\tborder-color: #fff;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-close,\n.fatesAtlasLine-infoclose {\n\tbackground-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' fill='%23fff' viewBox='0 0 8 8'%3e%3cpath d='M7 0 l -3 3 -3 -3 -1 1 3 3 -3 3 1 1 3 -3 3 3 1 -1 -3 -3 3 -3 -1 -1z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e\");\n\tbackground-repeat: no-repeat;\n\tbackground-position: center;\n\tposition: absolute;\n\ttop: 5px;\n\tright: 5px;\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\twidth: 48px;\n\tmax-width: 10%;\n\theight: 48px;\n\tcursor: pointer;\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infoclose {\n\tright: 10px;\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n}\ndiv#fatesAtlasLine-content {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-head {\n\tposition: absolute;\n\ttop: 5px;\n\tleft: 5px;\n\tline-height: 1;\n\tdisplay: flex;\n\talign-items: center;\n\tcolumn-gap: 8px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-head>img {\n\twidth: 45px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-title {\n\tdisplay: flex;\n\tflex-direction: column;\n\trow-gap: 5px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-title-2,\n.fatesAtlasLine-title-2 a {\n\tcolor: #fff;\n\tfont-size: 18px;\n\tletter-spacing: 2px;\n\tline-height: 1;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-title-1 {\n\tcolor: #E6CC96;\n\tfont-size: 14px;\n\tletter-spacing: 1px;\n\tline-height: 1;\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\ndiv#fatesAtlasLine-infocontent {\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tright: 0;\n\ttop: 0;\n\theight: 100%;\n\twidth: 300px;\n\tmax-width: 50%;\n\tbackground-color: #141A24;\n\tborder-left: 3px solid #E1CEA0;\n\tpadding: 50px 20px;\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.fatesAtlasInfo {\n\tdisplay: none;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\twidth: 100%;\n\theight: 100%;\n\tletter-spacing: 1px;\n\tline-height: 1.6;\n\toverflow: auto;\n\tfont-size: 14px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .title {\n\tcolor: #DAC190;\n\tfont-size: 16px;\n\tmargin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .Char {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n\twidth: 100%;\n\tpadding-top: calc(100% / 138 * 61);\n\tposition: relative;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .Char img {\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tleft: 50%;\n\ttop: 50%;\n\ttransform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n\tanimation: charswitch 10s infinite ease;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .Char img:nth-child(1) {\n\tanimation-delay: 0s;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .Char img:nth-child(2) {\n\tanimation-delay: -5s;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .CM {\n\tcolor: #c1c4c7;\n\tmargin-top: 10px;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent a {\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .name {\n\tfont-size: 18px;\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .name:hover {\n\ttext-decoration: underline;\n}\n.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent .text {\n\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\tcolor: #c1c4c7;\n}\n@media screen and (min-width:768px) {\n\t.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent::-webkit-scrollbar {\n\t\twidth: 10px;\n\t\theight: 10px;\n\t}\n\t.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n\t\tbackground: #BEBCC2;\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t}\n\t.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(255 255 255 / 20%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t}\n\t/*火狐浏览器样式*/\n\t.fatesAtlasLine-infocontent .infoContent {\n\t\tscrollbar-width: thin;\n\t\tscrollbar-color: rgb(190 188 194) rgb(255 255 255 / 20%);\n\t}\n}\n@media screen and (max-width:767px) {\n\t.linebox {\n\t\theight: calc(90vh - 5em);\n\t}\n\t.fatesAtlasLine-head {\n\t\tt